description	"Mira

Class: Bounty Hunter
Brief Overview:
a Mandalorian Neo-Crusader with demolitions/gadget expertise, a lightdagger, and Force Sensitivity

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- Shoto Lightsaber (Blue and Cyan)
-- 32.5% shorter reach
-- Chain Limit: 2
-- Saber Defense (1)
-- Cannot Saber Throw
-- Slap ^3[Gunbash]
- Mira's Wrist Launcher (UGL)
-- 100% more damage
-- 100% more velocity
- Ion Blast Mark III (Lightning Thrower)
-- 50% more RoF
-- Heavy Weight
-- 30% slower mag reload
- Pulse Grenades (3)
- Cryoban Grenades (2)
- Deadly Flash Mines (4)
-- 100% more damage
-- Blind on det

^5Force Powers:
- Sense (1)

^6Inventory:
- Electrobinoculars
- Personal Shield

^8Attributes:
- Healing (2)
- Dexterity (3)
- Demolitions Expert (Blast Armor)
- Tracking Beacon (See Tracked players)

^3Abilities:
- Gunkick ^3[CS1]
- Poison Tracking Darts (2) ^3[CS1 in melee]
-- Focus/Tracks on hit
- Wrist Laser ^3[CS2]
- Grappling Hook (2) ^3[CS4 in melee]
-- Disarms/Pulls on hit"
